1
00:00:00,919 --> 00:00:03,203
This video is for the quality team.

2
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:10,709
You will learn how to follow deadlines, nudge late requests, review every undo, close complaints, and send notices.

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,680
Sign in with your name and password.

4
00:00:16,771 --> 00:00:19,566
Deadlines and follow-up is your main page.

5
00:00:19,566 --> 00:00:24,957
Monthly requests are submitted from the 15th to the 20th and received by the 1st.

6
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:28,151
Emergency requests must be sent within 24 hours.

7
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:32,151
The monthly cycle shows which doctors have not submitted yet.

8
00:00:32,151 --> 00:00:35,701
The cards count overdue requests, and the time of each stage.

9
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:41,088
The past due list shows each late request, where it is stuck, and for how long.

10
00:00:41,088 --> 00:00:43,712
Tap Nudge to remind whoever is holding it.

11
00:00:44,163 --> 00:00:51,943
At the bottom, the undo log lists every step that procurement undid, with the reason, the person and the time.

12
00:00:52,393 --> 00:00:59,353
Complaints shows every problem reported by the nurses. Open the request to check, then tap Close when it is solved.

13
00:00:59,804 --> 00:01:06,404
Reports gives you the month by doctor, branch and clinic, with approval time and dispatch time.

14
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:14,199
To send a notice, choose who receives it: procurement, nursing, doctors, or everyone.

15
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:18,410
Write the message and tap Send. It appears on their page.

16
00:01:21,828 --> 00:01:30,031
Doctors live shows every doctor's open requests by stage: doctor review, new, approved, in preparation and sent.

17
00:01:30,031 --> 00:01:34,718
It refreshes every minute. Tap any number to see those requests.

18
00:01:35,169 --> 00:01:39,045
Doctor survey shows the satisfaction results of each cycle:

19
00:01:39,045 --> 00:01:45,747
response rate, average stars, the recommend score, every question, branches, trends and written notes.

20
00:01:45,747 --> 00:01:50,149
While the survey is open, remind the doctors who have not answered.

21
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:58,373
Doctor prices: by default, doctors see no prices. From this page you grant or withhold prices for each doctor.

22
00:01:58,373 --> 00:02:01,059
Every change is logged with your name.

23
00:02:01,511 --> 00:02:08,301
That's it. Check the late list every morning, and close complaints as soon as they are solved. Thank you!
